      "manual_source_review": "Before one bounded forward-only native call at 480x0.625, main validates predecessor ZIP/report, accepted terminal gradient/state/objective, executable and exact replay-gate CSV hashes, source fingerprints, fixture member hashes including canonical Bcan, and observation shape. It compares the native h=.625 run from the exact accepted h=.3125 terminal-gradient state using the same 105 points, W150/W300 targets, sigma 3e-4, N14/K12/EW1 profile. It checks physical guards, unchanged state/context/observations/brackets, recomputes each per-time objective in long double, and records direct total-cost delta separately from the stable sum of cross+quadratic residual changes. RMS thresholds remain diagnostics only.",
